      "text": "🚦 TRAFFIC ADVISORY – GRACE CANCER RUN 2025 🚦\n\n Date: 12th October 2025 (Sunday)\n⏰ Time: 5:30 AM to 8:30 AM\n\n📍 Location: Gachibowli Main Stadium to IIIT Junction via Wipro Junction (10 KM Route)\n\n🔀 TRAFFIC DIVERSIONS:\n\n1️⃣ Wipro Junction:\nTraffic from Wipro Circle → IIIT Junction will be diverted towards Nanakramguda–ORR.\n\n2️⃣ IIIT Junction:\n\nTraffic from Mehdipatnam → Lingampally via HCU, Masjidbanda T-junction will operate on one side of the carriageway.\nTwo-way traffic permitted on the right side towards Lingampally.\n\n🚛 HEAVY VEHICLE RESTRICTION:\n\nFrom 05:00 AM to 08:30 AM, movement of trucks, lorries, DCMs, goods carriers, RMC, and water tankers is not allowed in the above-mentioned routes.\n\n#TrafficAdvisory #GraceCancerRun2025 #CyberabadTraffic #Gachibowli #RoadSafety #PlanYourTravel #TrafficUpdate #GachibowliTraffic\n\n@cyberabadpolice @SCSC_Cyberabad @GACHIBOWLITRAF7",
